flowchart TB
    subgraph Cabinet [高压开关柜结构]
        direction TB
        subgraph Upper [上部隔室]
            direction LR
            A[仪表室<br>继电保护装置] --- B[母线室<br>主母线]
        end
        C[断路器室<br>真空断路器]
        D[电缆室<br>电缆终端 & 互感器]
        
        Upper --- C
        C --- D
    end
    style Cabinet fill:#fff,stroke:#000,stroke-width:2px
    style Upper fill:#fff,stroke:#000,stroke-dasharray: 5 5
    style A fill:#fff,stroke:#000
    style B fill:#fff,stroke:#000
    style C fill:#fff,stroke:#000
    style D fill:#fff,stroke:#000
